url: "https://kursatkara.github.io/MAE3293_Fundamentals_of_Aerodynamics/"
abstract: >-
  Interactive lessons and calculators for the compressible-flow part of MAE 3293,
  Fundamentals of Aerodynamics, at Oklahoma State University: compressible flow
  preliminaries, normal shock waves, oblique shock and expansion waves, and nozzles,
  diffusers and wind tunnels, with calculators for isentropic flow, normal and oblique
  shocks, Prandtl-Meyer expansion and supersonic airfoils. Every figure is computed
  from the compressible-flow relations for a calorically perfect gas, and each page
  is a single self-contained file that also works offline.
